From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: kp-cvd-adb <kp@cuttlefish>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] adb: configurable adbd listening port
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

[KBOX_ADB] adbd listening port can be configured via the kernel cmdline parameter
androidboot.adb.tcp.port (e.g. launch_cvd --extra_kernel_cmdline="androidboot.adb.tcp.port=44400").
Property priority: service.adb.tcp.port > ro.boot.adb.tcp.port > persist.adb.tcp.port
(Cuttlefish default 5555).

Pairs with device-google-cuttlefish-0005-configurable-adb-guest-port.patch which
injects androidboot.adb.tcp.port via --adb_guest_port.

---
diff --git a/daemon/main.cpp b/daemon/main.cpp
index 77e535af..7635b168 100644
--- a/daemon/main.cpp
+++ b/daemon/main.cpp
@@ -266,6 +266,13 @@ int adbd_main(int server_port) {
     std::string prop_addr = android::base::GetProperty("service.adb.listen_addrs", "");
     if (prop_addr.empty()) {
         std::string prop_port = android::base::GetProperty("service.adb.tcp.port", "");
+        if (prop_port.empty()) {
+            // [KBOX] adbd 监听端口可通过 kernel cmdline 参数 androidboot.adb.tcp.port 配置，
+            // 例如：launch_cvd ... --extra_kernel_cmdline="androidboot.adb.tcp.port=44400"。
+            // init 会将 androidboot.* 转换为 ro.boot.* 属性。未配置时回落到
+            // persist.adb.tcp.port（Cuttlefish 默认 5555）。
+            prop_port = android::base::GetProperty("ro.boot.adb.tcp.port", "");
+        }
         if (prop_port.empty()) {
             prop_port = android::base::GetProperty("persist.adb.tcp.port", "");
         }
